[I] Loads one of several alternate underlying implementations for a module

[T] Module::Implementation loads one of several alternative implementations
[T] of a module, typically a fast XS one with a pure Perl fallback, and
[T] records which one is in use.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/Module-Implementation

